{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on backgammon, players gain buffs that amplify the effects of the squares. Deck-building roguelike-like play experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Backgammon with the goal of never ending.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is played by rolling dice to move pieces on the board. Play continues until there are no more dice left, at which point the game ends. The score of the game is the amount of money in your possession at that point.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Effects of squares</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several types of squares</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money - You can earn money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal - You can purchase and sell products. News may serve as a reference for product price fluctuations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Event - Random effects occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store - Items and dice can be purchased.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Purchase of buffs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items can be purchased at the store, each of which can amplify the effect of a square. There is also synergy between buffs, which requires players to be strategic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Item Card</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A one-time-use item. It provides an advantage in the game, such as overwriting the type of a map tile.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3879840/a855798bca700284d90db35a99eb6dbb83d07565.jpg"},{"name":"Something good will happen?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3879840/a855798bca700284d90db35a99eb6dbb83d07565.jpg"},{"name":"What will happen?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3879840/a855798bca700284d90db35a99eb6dbb83d07565.jpg"},{"name":"Do not underestimate these cards","path":"https://cdn.akamai.stea